{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107890","id":2611359626,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bpi-K","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107890","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107890.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107890.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107890","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107890/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107890/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107890/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/209986bde042bb2da07f1e922703cc67b68802ee","number":107890,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Highlight points on hover in the Polygon2D editor","user":{"login":"Nikitf777","id":127026067,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5JDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127026067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikitf777","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nikitf777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The Polygon2D editor now highlights a point, if it's near the mouse cursor. It especially useful on touchpads, where it's much harder to aim.\r\nBut I was surprised how much it improves the mouse experience as well. And now I don't want to go back to the previuos behavior, because it was awful.\r\nHowever, the Polygon2D editor is far from perfect and still needs a few improvements.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00cd77a2-8546-4549-b5c9-0636b435e4ee\r\n\r\nThe downside of this improvement is performance, because now the editor needs to redraw more often and iterate through the array of points on every mouse move. However, it's well optimized, because it redraws only when the highlighted point is changed and avoids looping when is_creating is true, checking only the first point.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6",